@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}
<h2 class="section-title">Privacy and data handling</h2>
<div class="card">
    <div class="card-body">
        <p class="mb-2">Impact Nexus stores personal information about volunteers, beneficiaries, donors and staff for the purpose of managing CSR and CSI programmes.</p>
        <ul class="mb-0">
            <li>Access is limited by role and by company ownership, enforced on the server.</li>
            <li>Passwords are stored using ASP.NET Core Identity password hashing; plaintext passwords are never persisted.</li>
            <li>Financial records and beneficiary records are only visible to authorised staff, the relevant donor, or the beneficiary themselves.</li>
            <li>Development seed data uses fictional people and must not be used in production.</li>
            <li>For production, configure HTTPS, a production connection string stored in user secrets or environment variables, and a real email provider for password reset.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
